// A list-literal spread of a call's fresh record list beside a part at a wider record (D16444):
// the call is copied element by element into the literal's element, at every position, in
// both faces. The proof adds a fraction, so it prints only if the spread's field is a float.
//
// Format: scripts/capability-probes/README.md, "Template format".
// @@PRELUDE@@
function mk() { return [{ x: 1 }, { x: 3 }] }
// @@VALUE@@
[{ x: 2.5 }, ...mk()]
// @@TYPE@@
{ x: f64 }[]
// @@PROOF@@
print(v[2].x + 0.25 + v.length)
// @@WANT@@
6.25
// @@SKIP@@
is_in_if: the value is a list, not a union — there is no arm to test it against
is_in_while: same
is_in_and: same
is_in_not: same
else_if: same
early_return_guard: same
